     "object": "s_hoil_veitavid",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "הואיל ואיתעביד בה חדא מצוה ליתעביד בה מצוה אחריתי",
     "supports": "p_ami_asi_rifta_deeruva",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_raavtanuta",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "והא מיחזי כרעבתנותא? -- but that looks like gluttony!",
     "against": "p_zeira_akula_shiruta",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_kol_yoma_lo",
     "gloss_en": "כיון דכל יומא לא עביד, והאידנא הוא דקעביד -- לא מיחזי כרעבתנותא",
     "answers": "obj_raavtanuta",
     "restores": "p_zeira_akula_shiruta"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rav_kahana_tartei",
     "gloss_en": "Rav Ashi: I saw Rav Kahana take two [loaves] and break one"
    }
   ]
  },
  "2": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.117b.3",
   "sugya": "shabbat_117b_bahul_al_mamono",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_natzil_tfei",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "since he exerts himself with what is permitted, let him rescue more!",
     "against": "p_mishna_leilei_shalosh",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_bahul_al_mamono",
     "gloss_en": "מתוך שאדם בהול על ממונו, אי שרית ליה אתי לכבויי",
     "answers": "obj_natzil_tfei",
     "restores": "p_mishna_leilei_shalosh"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_abaye_chavit",
     "kind": "tanya",
     "gloss_en": "אלא הא דתניא: נשברה לו חבית... ובלבד שלא יביא כלי אחר ויקלוט -- התם מאי גזירה איכא?",
     "against": "p_rava_bahul_al_mamono",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_gezera_derech_rhr",
     "gloss_en": "הכא נמי גזירה שמא יביא כלי דרך רשות הרבים -- the barrel case has its own decree",
     "answers": "obj_abaye_chavit",
     "restores": "p_rava_bahul_al_mamono"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rava_bahul_al_mamono",
     "gloss_en": "Rava: since a person is agitated about his property, if you permit him [more], he will come to extinguish"
    }
   ]
  },
  "7": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.117b.8",
   "sugya": "shabbat_117b_bahul_al_mamono",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_ini_tdry",
     "kind": "tanya",
     "gloss_en": "איני?! והא תנא דבי רבי ישמעאל: לא תעשה כל מלאכה -- יצא תקיעת שופר ורדיית הפת שהיא חכמה ואינה מלאכה",
